      "text": "rocky diff  /  git post-commit hook\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSource:   git diff (actual code)\nTrigger:  manual or post-commit\ninitial_r: 0.5  (neutral)\ncreated_at: today\ncanonical Q&A: generated at insertion\ncanonical clue: generated at insertion\nedges: generated after batch\n\n\u26a0 Co-Authored-By trailer detectable here\n  \u2192 proposed: co_authored=true if present",
